bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[center][b][u]Thanks for Downloading[/u][/b][/center]

Thank you for downloading this [b]Advanced Third-Person Controller[/b]! This controller is designed to offer a wide range of features and flexibility for your game projects. I hope it enhances your development experience and helps you create something amazing.

If you find this Advanced Third-Person Controller useful, consider supporting my work by [url=https://ko-fi.com/neonfirestudio][b]Ko-fi[/b][/url]. If you don't have an account there, you can also support me through [url=https://neonfire-studio.itch.io/godot-advanced-third-person-controller][b]Itch.io[/b][/url]. Your support is greatly appreciated and helps me continue to improve and add more features!

[url=https://github.com/NeonfireStudio/godot-advanced-third-person-controller/blob/main/FuturePlan.md][b]Take a look at the development plan for it.[/b][/url]

[u][b]Features (v1.0):[/b][/u]
[ul] Basic Movement [/ul]
[ul] Strafing [/ul]
[ul] Locomotion [/ul]
[ul] Run To Stop [/ul]
[ul] Rolling/Sliding [/ul]
[ul] Hard Land on Fall From Height [/ul]
[ul] Basic Melee [/ul]
[ul] Picking Up Object [/ul]
[ul] 4 Types Of Emotes [/ul]
[ul] Animated Godette Character [/ul]
[ul] Simple Menu [/ul]
[ul] Basic Multiplayer [/ul]
[ul] Footstep Based On Material [/ul]
[ul] Stylish Environment [/ul]
[ul] Easily Editable Controller [/ul]
...And More Coming In Future!

[u][b]Known Issues[/b][/u]
[ul] Footstep sound may not work in Multiplayer Mode [/ul]
[ul] Picking up object may not work in Multiplayer Mode[/ul]
[ul] You cannot get or set player rotation directly through code. Use the set_player_rotation and get_player_rotation functions for handling rotation instead. [/ul]
...I will try to fix it in the future version.

[u][b]Important Note[/b][/u]
[ul] This template's performance and features depend heavily on the quality of your character model and animations. [/ul]

[u][b]Controls[/b][/u]
[ul] Movement | WASD [/ul]
[ul] Strafe | Right Mouse [/ul]
[ul] Sprint | Shift [/ul]
[ul] Jump | Space [/ul]
[ul] Crouch | CTRL [/ul]
[ul] Attack | Left Mouse [/ul]
[ul] Roll | Shift+C [/ul]
[ul] Slide | Shift+V [/ul]
[ul] Pick Up Object | F [/ul]
[ul] Emotes | 1-4 [/ul]
[ul] Zoom In/Out | Scroll Up/Down [/ul]
[ul] Toggle Fullscreen | F11 [/ul]
[ul] Show Cursor | Tab [/ul]
[ul] Return to Menu | ESC [/ul]

[center][b][u]Credits[/u][/b][/center]
Project Presented By: [b][url=https://neonfire-studio.itch.io]Neonfire Studio[/url][/b]
Project Developed By: [b]Sandipan Saha[/b]
Godette Model Created By: [b][url=https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/godette-rigged-dd05b69799a2438e97c90d166f6e416a]zahlenmaler[/url][/b]
Godette Model Animated By: Sandipan Saha
Godot Plush Model By: [b][url=https://fr3nkd.gumroad.com/l/vhfvy]FR3NKD[/url][/b]
Grid Textures & Sounds From: [b][url=https://kenney.nl]Kenney[/url][/b]
Some Shaders Taken From [url=https://godotshaders.com]Godot Shaders[/url]

[center][b][u]Copyright[/u][/b][/center]
Licensed under the [url=https://opensource.org/license/mit][b]MIT License[/b][/url]:
[ul] You are free to use this project for both commercial and non-commercial purposes. [/ul]
[ul] You may not resell this project or any of its components.[/ul]
[ul] You may not create YouTube tutorials or other instructional content based on this project without permission. [/ul]

Godette Model’s Animations License:
[ul] This model is available for use in non-commercial projects only. [/ul]

Others:
[ul] The other assets are under CCO Licensed [/ul]

[center][b][u]Social Links[/u][/b][/center]
[ul] [b][url=https://www.youtube.com/@NeonfireStudio]Youtube Channel[/url][/b] [/ul]
